  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your char-grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, combine haricot beans, olive oil, char-grill seasoning, and garlic. Mix well to coat.",
    "Thread the bean mixture onto skewers, leaving a little space between each bean.",
    "Grill the skewers for 5-7 minutes per side, or until the beans are lightly charred.",
    "Transfer the skewers to a serving platter and top with grated cheese.",
